ah/26-55.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:55 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"&quot;Kuma lalle ne sũ, a gare Mu, Mãsu fusãtarwa ne.&quot;\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/26.html\">Sura Ash-Shu&#x27;araa</a> › Aya 55</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:55</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِنَّهُمْ لَنَا لَغَائِظُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">&quot;Kuma lalle ne sũ, a gare Mu, Mãsu fusãtarwa ne.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وإنما يقال: غظته لا يقال: غظت له<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 7/291</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s26a55\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/26-10.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (26:10)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/26-57.html\">Aya ta gaba (26:57)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Sh